// LLAMP-SPEC v1 | ADR-001
=adr: 001
=title: MongoDB Migration from PostgreSQL
=date: 2026-02-12
=status: accepted

#ctx
~initial: PostgreSQL 16 + Prisma + TimescaleDB
~trigger: client required MongoDB time-series support
~stage: early POC (low migration cost)

#opts
~alt1: stay PostgreSQL + TimescaleDB (rejected: client requirement)
~alt2: hybrid DB (rejected: complexity)

#decision
=chosen: MongoDB 8 + Mongoose 8.x + Time Series Collections
=db: PostgreSQL → MongoDB 8
=orm: Prisma 5.x → Mongoose 8.23.0
=timeseries: TimescaleDB hypertables → MongoDB TS Collections
=ids: UUID 36ch → ObjectId 24hex
=retention: TimescaleDB jobs → MongoDB TTL indexes
!replica_set: REQUIRED even for local dev

#consequences
+pos: [native_ts_support, doc_flexibility, simpler_deploy, horizontal_scale]
-neg: [no_fk_constraints→manual_validation, ts_deletes_no_transactions→sequential, replica_required, lean()_needed→type_cast]
~migration: 8 phases, 63/63 tests passing

#scope
=arch_summary_update: yes
